  "final": "I added `GET /api/documents/<id>/download` in `docs_app/routes.py`. The full test suite passes, including the new download tests.\n\n- **Response:** a 200 with the raw file content, sent as an attachment (`Content-Disposition`, `application/octet-stream`, `nosniff`). The filename in the header is sanitized.\n- **Access control:** the lookup is scoped to the caller's account. A document that belongs to another account gets the same 404 as a missing one, so the endpoint doesn't reveal which ids exist. Requests without a valid token get a 401.\n- **Tests and docs:** I added tests for downloading your own document, another account's document (404), a missing id (404) and no auth (401). I also added the endpoint to the README.",
